<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάβροχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβρέχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very wet, moist,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					503
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγκος ὕδασι δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1051
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				167b7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>soaked, sodden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς δ.</span>”
				<i>leaky,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάρξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					870a11
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτι, μέθῃ δ.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>tearful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. δάκρυσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					1.26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
